      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّعَاقُمُ</span></b>  is <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّعَاقُبُ</span>, (K, TA,) <i>The
coming to water</i> [<i>by turns,</i> or] <i>time after time;</i>
and some say that the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span> of the former is a substitute for the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ب</span> of the latter. (TA.)

